# Copy to .env.local and fill in to switch the catalogue to live RAWG data.
# Without a key the site runs on the bundled offline catalogue (18 titles) —
# every route, filter and page works exactly the same.
#
# Get a free key in ~1 minute: https://rawg.io/apidocs → "Get API key"
# Free tier: 20,000 requests/month, no card required.

RAWG_API_KEY=
